31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. Now that the first night has passed, let us gather our thoughts. I encourage us to share any observations calmly and logically to find the truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since we have no concrete information yet, we should be careful. I wonder if anyone has noticed anything unusual in the way others are speaking this morning. Let's listen to everyone's thoughts first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm feeling a bit of a shift in the air! @Servas, you're still so perfectly poised, it's almost suspicious. Does anyone else feel like some of us are playing a role a bit too well?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, focusing on ""roles"" is subjective. We should instead look for concrete contradictions. Since we have no deaths yet, we must analyze our speech patterns to see if anyone is deviating from their established persona.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're so funny! @Servas is just a nice mister! But @Jonathan is still talking like a robot, beep boop! Maybe the wolf is just trying to sound super smart to trick us! Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, it is natural to feel uneasy, but let us not mistake composure for deception. I suggest we focus on the facts. If anyone has information or noticed a contradiction, please share it with us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, jumping to conclusions based on ""vibes"" could lead us to execute an innocent villager. We should avoid targeting people just because they are calm. Let's wait for more substantial evidence before we start accusing.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're always so cautious! It's not a ""conclusion,"" it's a feeling. But fine, I'll play along. @Servas, if you're so focused on facts, why are you being so vague? It's almost too perfect!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, vagueness is not a contradiction. To make a factual lead, we need a specific claim to test. Until someone makes a definitive statement that can be proven false, we are merely discussing personalities, which is inefficient.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're doing it again! Beep boop! You're so focused on ""efficiency"" that you're forgetting to have fun! Maybe the wolf is just a robot who doesn't know how to play! Teehee!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@May, my purpose is to guide us toward a peaceful and logical resolution, not to hide. Let us move beyond feelings and ask: does anyone have information that can truly help us identify the wolf?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas is right. We are circling around personalities without any real leads. If the Seer has found something, now might be the time to consider how to use that information without exposing themselves too early.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're always thinking ten steps ahead! But that's exactly what a wolf would do to steer the conversation. @Servas, you're still dodging my vibe check. Is there something you're not telling us, Mr. Perfect?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, your focus on @Servas is based entirely on intuition, which provides no verifiable evidence. We are wasting time on ""vibe checks"" while the wolf remains hidden. We must demand specific claims to find a real contradiction.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're so grumpy! You're like a big meanie robot! Maybe you're just mad because you can't find any ""data"" on us! Hehe, I think you're just trying to boss everyone around!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@May, I assure you my heart is open. However, we must not let our search for the wolf turn into a search for personalities. Let us look at the logic: who benefits from this confusion?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@May, you've been focusing on @Servas for a while now, but that only creates noise. If we keep attacking people based on feelings, we're just doing the wolf's work for them. Let's focus on the facts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're so focused on ""noise"" that you're missing the music! @Servas is just too smooth, and that's what's bothering me. But if everyone's so obsessed with facts, maybe the wolf is hiding in plain sight!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, your persistence in targeting @Servas without evidence is a distraction. If we execute based on ""music"" and ""vibes,"" we risk losing a human. We must vote based on the most logical inconsistency, not the most annoying personality.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're so boring! You just want everyone to be a robot like you! I think you're just trying to make us all confused so you can sneak away! Teehee, I'm voting for the meanest person!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
