64,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Servas was executed, and May was attacked. This is a strange combination. If Servas were the wolf, why would the wolf attack May? It seems May was targeted to make her look like a threat or a teammate.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, your observation is logical. If Servas were the werewolf, attacking May—who was actively accusing him—would be a strategic move to eliminate a vocal opponent or create confusion. However, we must also consider the Possessed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, May is gone too? That's so sad! But @Misaki, maybe the wolf just didn't like May's ""vibes"" and wanted her to be quiet! Hehe, this is getting really spooky! Who do you think is the bad guy now?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, the Possessed is certainly a factor. However, the fact that May was attacked suggests the wolf wanted her gone. If Servas was innocent, the wolf might have attacked May to frame him or simply to remove a disruptive element.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, that is a valid point. However, we must also analyze the voting patterns. Servas received two votes, including mine. If he was innocent, the wolf and the Possessed likely voted for him to ensure his execution. We must now scrutinize the remaining players.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're always talking about ""scrutinizing"" and ""analyzing""! It's making my head spin! Maybe you're just trying to sound smart so we don't notice you're the wolf! Teehee, you're still being a meanie robot!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, focusing on @Jonathan's personality again is just a distraction. We need to look at the results. If the wolf is still among us, they are likely the one trying to steer us away from the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, I agree. Since I have confirmed that both May and you are human, the wolf must be either Sakura or the executed Servas. If Servas was human, the wolf is certainly Sakura. We should examine her behavior for inconsistencies.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""May"",""Sakura"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, what?! You can't just say that! How do you know Misaki and May are human? Are you the Seer? If you are, why are you being so mean to me? I'm just a little girl! Waaaaah!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, if you are the Seer, revealing your results so abruptly is a risky move. @Sakura, please calm down. Let's focus on whether Jonathan's claim is true, as that changes everything for our vote.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am the Seer. I divined May on night 0 and Misaki on night 1; both are human. By process of elimination, if Servas was not the wolf, Sakura must be. The facts are now clear.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki"",""Servas"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're a big fat liar! You're just making things up to get me in trouble! I'm just a little girl, I can't be the wolf! You're the meanest robot ever! Waaaaah!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
